WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.375
Welcome to Lee's Detective Agency.

00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:05.541
We accept all manner of requests

00:00:05.541 --> 00:00:08.000
which sometimes include special cases

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:09.875
like detective work.

00:00:09.875 --> 00:00:12.791
Reality can be far more surprising than fiction.

00:00:12.791 --> 00:00:18.000
But we'll let the police handle the actual investigation.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.750
Detectives like us must stay in the shadows

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:24.916
because the light will rob us of our secrecy.

00:00:24.916 --> 00:00:26.125
The same goes for everyone.

00:00:26.125 --> 00:00:27.666
Being placed under the spotlight

00:00:27.666 --> 00:00:30.416
will make people look different.

00:00:53.416 --> 00:00:57.125
The day just ended for someone.

00:00:58.875 --> 00:01:03.875
And the day just started for somebody.

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:08.500
In empty streets I walked about

00:01:09.791 --> 00:01:14.291
Confessing my boredom out loud.

00:01:15.041 --> 00:01:16.750
I wanna keep feeling it

00:01:16.875 --> 00:01:20.416
But you won't forget about this

00:01:21.791 --> 00:01:25.291
Knock Three Times, before requesting.

00:01:25.875 --> 00:01:27.416
I wanna keep touching it

00:01:27.625 --> 00:01:31.375
Trouble's no longer a thing

00:01:31.666 --> 00:01:33.750
When a future

00:01:34.041 --> 00:01:37.041
You just waved to me.

00:01:37.041 --> 00:01:38.416
I wanna keep feeling it

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:42.291
But you won't forget about this

00:01:43.625 --> 00:01:47.375
Knock Three Times, before requesting.

00:01:47.375 --> 00:01:49.000
I wanna keep touching it

00:01:49.541 --> 00:01:53.291
Trouble's no longer a thing

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:55.541
When a future

00:01:55.916 --> 00:01:58.916
You just waved to me.

00:02:10.375 --> 00:02:15.083
A Minute of Investigation

00:02:27.750 --> 00:02:30.375
The boss just got some new art.

00:02:30.625 --> 00:02:33.000
This painting looks fake.

00:02:41.000 --> 00:02:42.000
Look.

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:57.875
I guess you saw through the disguise.

00:03:06.875 --> 00:03:08.541
Please, come in.

00:03:16.666 --> 00:03:17.750
Excuse me.

00:03:23.375 --> 00:03:24.875
The Lungmen Guard Department has just received a report.

00:03:25.416 --> 00:03:30.875
Mr. Meng, a high ranking banker, has gone missing.

00:03:35.625 --> 00:03:36.416
Who is she?

00:03:37.166 --> 00:03:40.166
You met Mr. Meng at the bar last time.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.875
I'll let Mrs. Meng take over from here.

00:03:44.041 --> 00:03:45.541
But I thought this case

00:03:45.541 --> 00:03:47.250
is being investigated by the LGD.

00:03:50.541 --> 00:03:53.541
He kept a secret lover.

00:03:55.125 --> 00:03:59.375
The two of them escaped during the investigation.

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:04.500
How did you learn that he left on his own?

00:04:08.875 --> 00:04:09.500
These

00:04:10.750 --> 00:04:11.791
are the evidences.

00:04:14.250 --> 00:04:17.000
The plane tickets they bought.

00:04:18.416 --> 00:04:20.375
His bank records.

00:04:21.625 --> 00:04:24.500
And his receipts for buying jewelry.

00:04:25.666 --> 00:04:27.500
Why did things end up this way?

00:04:28.375 --> 00:04:31.250
So what do you want us to do for you?

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:36.375
He deposited our shared assets

00:04:36.375 --> 00:04:38.250
into an encrypted gold card

00:04:38.250 --> 00:04:41.375
and placed it at Lee's DA for safekeeping.

00:04:41.375 --> 00:04:42.625
The money.

00:04:42.625 --> 00:04:44.125
I want it back.

00:04:46.666 --> 00:04:48.166
I'm sorry, ma'am.

00:04:48.375 --> 00:04:52.125
A case can only be terminated by the original client in person.

00:04:54.291 --> 00:04:55.291
I understand.

00:04:55.625 --> 00:04:58.125
It's alright, thank you.

00:04:58.416 --> 00:05:02.125
I'll just sell the house. That will keep me alive for a while.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:03.750
WAIT!

00:05:06.000 --> 00:05:08.375
I guess we can make an exception.

00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:34.000
The half that doesn't belong to me

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.125
will go to the LGD.

00:05:36.625 --> 00:05:39.250
That will be it for today. Farewell.

00:05:39.916 --> 00:05:40.625
WAIT!

00:05:48.750 --> 00:05:49.625
Mrs. Meng,

00:05:50.041 --> 00:05:51.875
we'll need you to sign a few forms.

00:05:53.000 --> 00:05:55.041
It's part of our agency's contract process.

00:05:59.041 --> 00:06:01.250
What should we have for dinner tonight?

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:11.250
Why don't you stay for dinner?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:14.000
We're having chocolate coral fin tonight.

00:06:18.041 --> 00:06:20.000
That's so kind of you,

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.791
but I really have other matters to attend to.

00:06:26.625 --> 00:06:27.791
What is it, young man?

00:06:29.416 --> 00:06:30.791
This smells familiar.

00:06:31.625 --> 00:06:32.875
What are you doing, boy?

00:06:33.750 --> 00:06:34.375
Well, old lady,

00:06:34.625 --> 00:06:36.000
you've consumed a chemical

00:06:36.375 --> 00:06:38.375
that smells a little like ethanol

00:06:38.375 --> 00:06:39.541
except that it isn't.

00:06:39.791 --> 00:06:41.541
It's actually a product of loxic kohl.

00:06:42.125 --> 00:06:44.625
Your coat is brand new,

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:47.500
and you're allergic to animal fur.

00:06:47.875 --> 00:06:50.500
That explains the slight rash under your ears.

00:06:51.041 --> 00:06:55.416
Why would someone wearing fur coats all the time be allergic to it?

00:06:56.375 --> 00:06:58.125
Despite being married to a renowned banker,

00:06:58.541 --> 00:07:02.000
the first digit of your right index finger is callused.

00:07:02.000 --> 00:07:03.375
I guess being an assassin

00:07:03.375 --> 00:07:05.791
forces you to hold blades all the time.

00:07:06.125 --> 00:07:07.791
And most importantly,

00:07:07.791 --> 00:07:09.250
you are a man!

00:07:15.000 --> 00:07:15.875
SHUT THE DOOR!

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:23.125
I should have killed you all from the start

00:07:23.375 --> 00:07:25.541
and not put up with this stupid acting.

00:07:39.375 --> 00:07:41.791
Have a taste of my stimpack.

00:08:21.375 --> 00:08:25.500
The LGD Special Inspection Unit has found the body of the missing banker Mr. Meng.

00:08:25.750 --> 00:08:29.000
The suspect murderer has been apprehended.

00:08:29.291 --> 00:08:31.625
The motivation of this crime is money.

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:36.000
We now go live with our correspondent and Officer Hoshiguma at the crime scene.

00:08:36.125 --> 00:08:37.166
So that fox

00:08:37.166 --> 00:08:39.375
also disguised as this lady.

00:08:39.625 --> 00:08:40.000
Aak.

00:08:40.250 --> 00:08:43.125
If it weren't for you, that fox would have deceived the old man as well.

00:08:44.791 --> 00:08:45.250
Hey! Where's Aak?

00:08:48.375 --> 00:08:50.166
I think he went to the mini-mart.

00:08:58.000 --> 00:09:02.958
To be continued...

00:09:05.000 --> 00:09:06.333
Mrs. Meng requested Lee's D.A 

00:09:06.333 --> 00:09:07.625
to return the gold card 

00:09:07.625 --> 00:09:10.458
that Mr. Meng entrusted the Agency for safekeeping.

00:09:10.458 --> 00:09:12.666
According to our partnership contract with Mr. Meng, 

00:09:12.666 --> 00:09:15.125
the gold card can only be returned to Mr. Meng in person. 

00:09:15.125 --> 00:09:17.333
Should special circumstances apply, 

00:09:17.333 --> 00:09:19.916
the requestor must first prove that she is Mrs. Meng herself.

